    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3946308291",
      "Source": "A magic gem filled with ancient magic to enter the arena of the Bane of Thurduar.<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一颗充满远古魔法的神奇宝石，用于进入灾厄之主·瑟杜尔的竞技场。<#RN#><RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">每个生物一次只能携带一颗此宝石.</>","JA":""},
