      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of many structures in a dwarven-style. Made for Svartalfheim map but can be used on any map. <#RN#><#RN#>This is Variant 1 of 2. Use the other Variant Skin Items to have more variety.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以用它将许多建筑的外观改为矮人风格。专为矮人国度地图设计，但也可在任何地图上使用。<#RN#><#RN#>这是 2 种变体中的第 1 种。使用其他变体皮肤物品可获得更多样式。","JA":""},
